{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1242.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"3644d016eeaf195890af218995de9fc432449d2804efc3923300ef218d3ea258","ja":"行きづらい場所","zh":"难以到达的地方","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1242.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"11605c4f1f4754b127224f231c06d90ab992db40691fb4bbcad67c6feef60f1a","ja":"えっと……こちらの駅に行くには\nここで乗り換えて、さらにこちらの駅で……うう……。","zh":"那个……要去这边的车站的话，\n要在这里换乘，然后在这边的车站……呜呜……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1242.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"3b8b458d39ac1fee0490e91b578897c8e20d3d5eb3bd0f04650ea80fb285d4ee","ja":"あら、それ、美術館のパンフレット？\nえーっと……『和雑貨古今東西展』……？","zh":"哎呀，那是美术馆的宣传册吗？\n我看看……《和风杂货古今东西展》……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1242.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"a5c1eab4ca0d575b6d086b03f3cac15bb5fa1b2f1d9788ba4f6b46ca42a1ed4f","ja":"はい。今度こちらで日本各地の和雑貨が\n集められた展示が開催されるそうなのです。","zh":"是的。听说下次这里将会举办\n汇聚了日本各地和风杂货的展览呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1242.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"57ebbee0c96c66c641a7ad945e10148c737fe62261c82ef93538e8f96caa395d","ja":"是非行ってみたいのですが、\nなかなか行きづらそうな場所にありまして……。","zh":"我也很想去看看，\n但那个地方好像挺难去的……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1242.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"2b39b82495f84e7135a83dcd48e31b7150bc6bf0331cbc11e4916609126d9c1a","ja":"どれどれ……そうね。\nこの場所だと、電車は結構面倒だと思うわ。","zh":"我来看看……确实呢。\n从这个地方走的话，坐电车感觉相当麻烦哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1242.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"041ecc24724bff5ccb005b0632d7efdbdb173bfa7f1e6ff5849496026e5b6d0c","ja":"やはりそうですか……。ですが、\n珍しい和雑貨が集まるこの機会を逃すわけには……。","zh":"果然是这样吗……。但是，\n难得有这么多罕见的日式杂货聚集在一起，我可不能错过这次机会……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1242.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"fb77623698441835160d8159be3d807b06163aa4034f521468ead5daf8f39861","ja":"十分に準備して伺おうと思います。\n……電車の乗り継ぎも、なんとか間違わないように！","zh":"我会做好充分的准备前往的。\n……电车换乘也一定要争取别坐错！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1242.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"9f70408ec581dd5727d25503fd9a9cf187626bac4f32c42dfa2bf506db8b30ae","ja":"大変そうね……あ、じゃあよかったら、\n私の車で一緒に行ってみない？","zh":"看起来挺不容易的呢……啊，那要是不介意的话，\n要不要坐我的车一起去？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1242.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"e08982d289c2652a9a5945c7bcb65aac2cbea000bff3ce48f1ed691c6ed8fe4d","ja":"えっ！　それはとてもありがたいのですが、\n桜守さんにご迷惑をかけてしまうのは……。","zh":"诶！那真是太感谢了，\n不过要是给樱守小姐添麻烦的话就……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1242.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"5281f1b2c7c649435326a9858f8e321718528ef864e9f5315b6191a2cb092d08","ja":"ううん、私も行ってみたくなったの♪\nかわいい小物雑貨が、たくさん見られるみたいだし。","zh":"不是啦，我也想去看看呢♪\n而且好像能看到好多可爱的小杂货。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1242.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"ee79f8e62cc87c3c4396f4c8a00f992cce0ba8bedfa46143bdc5bfc9db445874","ja":"ありがとうございます！\nそれでは、今回はお言葉に甘えさせていただきます♪","zh":"非常感谢！\n那么，这次我就恭敬不如从命了♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1242.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"4f072c73eb27fb513180e83f8dafd0cd73ca1bbea9196dbd8fa5c3cca88f2985","ja":"（車で送っていただけるのなら、安心ですね……。\nおや？　でも何か忘れているような……）","zh":"（要是能开车送我回去，那就让人放心了……\n哎呀？不过总觉得好像忘了什么……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
